id: pm-8skz5z
title: Adopt mature Knip 6.42.0 and CodeQL/CodSpeed action pins
description: "Implement the eligible portions of Dependabot PR1599 and PR1601 in combined PR1596. Adopt Knip6.42.0, CodeQL action4.39.0 and CodSpeed action5.5.0 after exact upstream age and immutable-tag verification. Preserve TruffleHog3.99.2 because3.99.3 is younger than seven days. Runtime Sentry11 migration stays outside this compatible tooling update."
