acceptance_criteria: "Verify each exact adopted upstream timestamp is older than seven full days and each action SHA matches its official tag; Pass frozen-lock install and dependency/advisory, static, workflow-permission, typecheck, full exact coverage and supported consumer checks without weakening policies; Keep immature TruffleHog and the unaccepted Sentry major outside the adoption; close superseded bot PRs with canonical PM links after reviewed combined delivery"
