resolution: "Adopt mature Knip, CodeQL and CodSpeed pins; activate pm-changelog 2026.10.26 and declare its upgrades command in the SDK destination/positional census and generated contracts."
expected_result: "The latest package activates and executes through npm and Bun, while SDK grammar, compatibility and immutable dependency policy gates describe every active command."
actual_result: "All linked commands and 23 focused cases pass; full suite 11461 pass,3skip at exact100/100/100/100 with unchanged denominators. Functional static and SDK import gates pass; qualified local transport failures also occur on immutable main and remain documented, with exact-head hosted admission still mandatory."
